{'symbol': 'LUV', 'date': '2022-10-12 16:21:00', 'title': "SOUTHWEST AIRLINES' AIRCRAFT APPEARANCE TECHNICIANS APPROVE NEW AGREEMENT", 'text': 'DALLAS , OCT. 12, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- SOUTHWEST AIRLINES CO. \xa0(NYSE: LUV) (THE "COMPANY") TODAY ANNOUNCED THE COMPANY\'S AIRCRAFT APPEARANCE TECHNICIANS, REPRESENTED BY THE AIRCRAFT MECHANICS FRATERNAL ASSOCIATION (AMFA), HAVE VOTED IN FAVOR OF A NEW FIVE-YEAR AGREEMENT. "THIS CONTRACT REWARDS OUR APPEARANCE TECHNICIANS WITH IMMEDIATE AND FUTURE COMPENSATION INCREASES WHILE CONTINUING TO SUPPORT SOUTHWEST\'S COMPETITIVE COST POSITION IN THE U.S. AIRLINE INDUSTRY," SAID ADAM CARLISLE , VICE PRESIDENT LABOR RELATIONS AT SOUTHWEST AIRLINES®.'}{'symbol': 'LUV', 'date': '2022-10-12 10:00:00', 'title': 'SOUTHWEST AIRLINES AND HISPANIC ASSOCIATION OF COLLEGES AND UNIVERSITIES ANNOUNCE RECIPIENTS FOR 18TH YEAR OF STUDENT TRAVEL AWARD PROGRAM', 'text': 'DALLAS , OCT. 12, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- SOUTHWEST AIRLINES CO. \xa0(NYSE: LUV) IN PARTNERSHIP WITH THE HISPANIC ASSOCIATION OF COLLEGES AND UNIVERSITIES (HACU), ANNOUNCED ITS 2022 RECIPIENTS FOR THE ¡LÁNZATE!/TAKE OFF! HIGHER EDUCATION TRAVEL AWARD PROGRAM.'}